# Paladin en-Vec, protection from black and from red (CR 702.16b-d): each color is its own protection. On turn 2 Bot2, with the
# mana for any of them, cannot target it with a black spell (Go for the Throat), a red spell (Lightning Bolt) or an Aura of
# either color - Ferocity of the Hunt, black and green, and Quicksilver Dagger, blue and red - while a green Rancor, the control,
# may enchant it. On turn 3 Bot1 cannot equip its own red Dire Flail to it, while the colorless Basilisk Collar attaches (the
# control) and gives it deathtouch and lifelink.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Paladin en-Vec
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Dire Flail
Basilisk Collar
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Go for the Throat
Lightning Bolt
Ferocity of the Hunt
Quicksilver Dagger
Rancor
Island x16

